ve me with only W5, T4, F1, F1 - highly scattered tiles that are difficult to develop into a winning hand; (2) My current hand already contains the B3-B4-B5 sequence naturally, so exposing it provides minimal benefit; (3) Keeping tiles concealed preserves options for higher-scoring patterns like \"Concealed Hand\" or \"Fully Concealed Hand\"; (4) With F1 appearing 3 times in unshown tiles, I have a chance to form a pung of F1 (my Seat Wind), which would add valuable points.\n\nAnswer: Pass"}
